# Pin our own executables and parsed data files to LF so a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true)
# cannot put a carriage return in a shebang or a roster line. Deliberately NOT a catch-all
# `* text=auto`: that would renormalize the three imported packs under skills/ and bury real
# subtree diffs in line-ending noise.
scripts/*.sh   text eol=lf
scripts/*.py   text eol=lf
scripts/*.txt  text eol=lf
